        {
          "id": 171,
          "hub_id": 14708,
          "version": "1.3.0",
          "description": "**For SPT 3.11.X Only**\n\nCouple new features!\n\n- **Unlock All Doors At End Of Raid**\n- **Old Lock Falloff**\n    - Makes it so that if you are at your cap for locked doors, and you lock *another* door, it unlocks the oldest locked door. Lets you keep locking doors without needing to go back and unlock the old ones or run the console command.\n\nBoth features are off by default, turn them on in F12 menu.\n\nThis update required a bit of refactoring, so lmk if you run into bugs.",
